{"suttaId":"tha-ap551","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-ii","vriCode":"s0510m2.mul","paras":[5735,5797],"vripara":"251"},"segments":{"tha-ap551:0.3":"Vanavacchattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap551:1.1":"“Imamhi bhaddake kappe, brahmabandhu mahāyaso;","tha-ap551:1.3":"Kassapo nāma gottena, uppajji vadataṃ varo.","tha-ap551:2.1":"“Tadāhaṃ pabbajitvāna, tassa buddhassa sāsane;","tha-ap551:2.3":"Yāvajīvaṃ caritvāna, brahmacāraṃ tato cuto.","tha-ap551:3.1":"“Tena kammena sukatena, cetanāpaṇidhīhi ca;","tha-ap551:3.3":"Jahitvā mānusaṃ dehaṃ, tāvatiṃsamagacchahaṃ.","tha-ap551:4.1":"“Tato cuto araññamhi, kapoto āsahaṃ tahiṃ;","tha-ap551:4.3":"Vasate guṇasampanno, bhikkhu jhānarato sadā.","tha-ap551:5.1":"“Mettacitto kāruṇiko, sadā pamuditānano;","tha-ap551:5.3":"Upekkhako mahāvīro, appamaññāsu kovido.","tha-ap551:6.1":"“Vinīvaraṇasaṅkappe, sabbasattahitāsaye;","tha-ap551:6.3":"Visaṭṭho nacirenāsiṃ, tasmiṃ sugatasāvake.","tha-ap551:7.1":"“Upecca pādamūlamhi, nisinnassa tadāssame;","tha-ap551:7.3":"Kadāci sāmisaṃ deti, dhammaṃ desesi cekadā.","tha-ap551:8.1":"“Tadā vipulapemena, upāsitvā jinatrajaṃ;","tha-ap551:8.3":"Tato cuto gato saggaṃ, pavāso sagharaṃ yathā.","tha-ap551:9.1":"“Saggā cuto manussesu, nibbatto puññakammunā;","tha-ap551:9.3":"Agāraṃ chaḍḍayitvāna, pabbajiṃ bahuso ahaṃ.","tha-ap551:10.1":"“Samaṇo tāpaso vippo, paribbajo tathevahaṃ;","tha-ap551:10.3":"Hutvā vasiṃ araññamhi, anekasataso ahaṃ.","tha-ap551:11.1":"“Pacchime ca bhave dāni, ramme kapilavatthave;","tha-ap551:11.3":"Vacchagotto dijo tassa, jāyāya ahamokkamiṃ.","tha-ap551:12.1":"“Mātu me dohaḷo āsi, tirokucchigatassa me;","tha-ap551:12.3":"Jāyamānasamīpamhi, vanavāsāya nicchayo.","tha-ap551:13.1":"“Tato me ajanī mātā, ramaṇīye vanantare;","tha-ap551:13.3":"Gabbhato nikkhamantaṃ maṃ, kāsāyena paṭiggahuṃ.","tha-ap551:14.1":"“Tato kumāro siddhattho, jāto sakyakuladdhajo;","tha-ap551:14.3":"Tassa mitto piyo āsiṃ, saṃvisaṭṭho sumāniyo.","tha-ap551:15.1":"“Sattasārebhinikkhante, ohāya vipulaṃ yasaṃ;","tha-ap551:15.3":"Ahampi pabbajitvāna, himavantamupāgamiṃ.","tha-ap551:16.1":"“Vanālayaṃ bhāvanīyaṃ, kassapaṃ dhutavādikaṃ;","tha-ap551:16.3":"Disvā sutvā jinuppādaṃ, upesiṃ narasārathiṃ.","tha-ap551:17.1":"“So me dhammamadesesi, sabbatthaṃ sampakāsayaṃ;","tha-ap551:17.3":"Tatohaṃ pabbajitvāna, vanameva punāgamaṃ [punāgamiṃ (sī. pī.), punokkamaṃ (syā.)].","tha-ap551:18.1":"“Tatthāppamatto viharaṃ, chaḷabhiññā aphassayiṃ [apassayiṃ (syā. ka.)];","tha-ap551:18.3":"Aho suladdhalābhomhi, sumittenānukampito.","tha-ap551:19.1":"“Kilesā jhāpitā mayhaṃ … pe … viharāmi anāsavo.","tha-ap551:20.1":"“Svāgataṃ vata me āsi … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ.","tha-ap551:21.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe … kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap551:22.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā vanavaccho thero imā gāthāyo Abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap551:23.1":"Vanavacchattherassāpadānaṃ navamaṃ."},"attha":{"book":"Ap-a","bookName":"Apadāna-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0510a.att","from":3727,"to":3727,"paras":[{"para":3727,"vripara":"251","refs":["tha-ap551:1"],"lines":["So arahattaṃ patvā attano pubbakammaṃ saritvā somanassajāto pubbacaritāpadānaṃ pakāsento <b>imamhi bhaddake kappe</b>tiādimāha.","Tattha <b>brahmabandhu mahāyaso</b>ti ettha brāhmaṇānaṃ bandhu ñātakoti brāhmaṇabandhūti vattabbe gāthābandhasukhatthaṃ “brahmabandhū”ti vuttanti veditabbaṃ.","Lokattayabyāpakayasattā mahāyaso.","Sesaṃ sabbaṃ suviññeyyamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["tha-ap551:1"],["tha-ap551:1"],["tha-ap551:1"],["tha-ap551:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[["tha-ap551:1.1","imamhi bhaddake kappe",0,0],["tha-ap551:1.1","brahmabandhu mahāyaso",0,1]]},"tika":null}
